# Xcode
**/xcuserdata/
**/build/
DerivedData/
*.xcresult
*.xccovreport
*.xccovarchive

# macOS
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local secrets, signing material and tool state: never commit these
.env
.env.*
*.p8
*.p12
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Python
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# Swift Package Manager: the workspace copy (BillBoard.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved)
# is authoritative. Xcode recreates this one if the project is opened on its own.
Billboard/Billboard.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved

# Personal simulator notes (UDIDs, local push commands)
Billboard/PushTests/*LocalTests.json
